### Production API Testing

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### List All Production Batches
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Production Batches with Filters
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?page=1&limit=10&status=PLANNED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Production Batch by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Production Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bomId": 10,
  "plannedQuantity": 100,
  "startDate": "2024-01-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-01-20T17:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Urgent production run for customer order",
  "workOrders": [
    {
      "stepName": "Cutting",
      "notes": "Cut fabric pieces"
    },
    {
      "stepName": "Sewing",
      "notes": "Sew pieces together"
    },
    {
      "stepName": "Quality Check",
      "notes": "Final quality inspection"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Update Production Batch (PLANNED only)
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plannedQuantity": 150,
  "notes": "Updated quantity based on customer request"
}

###

### Start Production Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2/start
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Complete Production Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actualQuantity": 98
}

###

### Cancel Production Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Material shortage - unable to complete production"
}

###

### Delete Production Batch (PLANNED only)
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search Production Batches by Batch Number
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?batchNo=PB-2026-0001
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter Production Batches by Date Range
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?startDateFrom=2026-01-01&startDateTo=2026-01-31
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Sort Production Batches
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?sortBy=startDate&sortOrder=ASC
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get IN_PROGRESS Batches
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?status=IN_PROGRESS
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get COMPLETED Batches
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?status=COMPLETED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get CANCELLED Batches
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?status=CANCELLED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Error - Create Batch with Invalid BOM
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bomId": 99999,
  "plannedQuantity": 100
}

###

### Test Error - Start Non-PLANNED Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2/start
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Error - Complete Non-IN_PROGRESS Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actualQuantity": 100
}

###

### Test Error - Cancel COMPLETED Batch
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Trying to cancel completed batch"
}

###

### Test Error - Delete Non-PLANNED Batch
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches/2
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Pagination - Page 2
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?page=2&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Complex Filters
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/production-batches?status=PLANNED&batchNo=PB&startDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC
Content-Type: application/json
